# Test: H2O MP2/6-31G analytical gradient
%method  MP2
%basis   6-31G
%frozen_core 0        # keep legacy reference values; see run_mp2grad_tests.sh comment
%job     gradient
%charge  0
%mult    1

*geometry angstrom
O   0.000000   0.000000   0.117369
H   0.000000   0.757160  -0.469476
H   0.000000  -0.757160  -0.469476
*end
